---
import '../../../styles/character-prototype.css';
import BaseLayout from '../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { methodLabels, source } from '../../../character/creation/model';
---
<BaseLayout title="创建角色 · 属性草稿" noIndex bodyClass="create-workspace" createStage="abilities"><div class="legacy-character-tools">
<nav class="character-subnav" aria-label="角色主导航"><a href="/character/">人物卡</a><a href="/character/create/">创建角色</a><a href="/character/sheet/">战役档案</a><a href="/character/growth/">角色成长</a><a href="/character/journal/">战役记录</a></nav>
<header class="workbar"><span>创建角色 · 第一阶段 / 属性草稿</span><div><a href="/character/create/core/">继续核心创建 →</a><button id="export-draft" type="button">导出草稿文件</button></div></header>
<section id="create-workspace" tabindex="-1" data-creation-navigation><div class="page-heading"><p class="eyebrow">创建角色 · 第一阶段</p><h1>从六项属性开始</h1><p>选择掷骰方法，分配属性后保存。</p></div><details class="create-resume"><summary>继续已有草稿、导入或新建</summary><div class="create-action-row"><select id="draft-library" aria-label="浏览器中的创建草稿"><option value="">选择草稿</option></select><button id="load-draft" type="button">加载草稿</button><button id="new-draft" type="button">新建空白草稿</button><label class="file-button">导入草稿<input id="import-draft" type="file" accept=".json,application/json" /></label></div><p>可从页首导出草稿备份。</p></details><p id="creation-status" class="app-status create-live-status" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p><div class="creation-layout create-layout"><div class="step-list create-step-list" role="tablist" aria-label="创建步骤"><button type="button" role="tab" id="create-tab-method" data-create-tab="method" aria-controls="create-panel-method" aria-selected="true" tabindex="0"><span>01</span>方法与骰点</button><button type="button" role="tab" id="create-tab-assign" data-create-tab="assign" aria-controls="create-panel-assign" aria-selected="false" tabindex="-1"><span>02</span>分配属性</button><button type="button" role="tab" id="create-tab-continue" data-create-tab="continue" aria-controls="create-panel-continue" aria-selected="false" tabindex="-1"><span>03</span>保存与继续</button></div><div class="create-step-content"><section class="paper-section create-step-panel" id="create-panel-method" data-create-panel="method" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="create-tab-method" ><h2 tabindex="-1">确定本团的属性生成方法</h2><p>先确定本战役允许的方法及重掷许可，所有原骰都会保留。</p><label>草稿姓名<input id="draft-name" maxlength="200" autocomplete="off" /></label><label for="generation-method">DMG 生成方法</label><select id="generation-method">{Object.entries(methodLabels).map(([id,label]) => <option value={id}>{label}</option>)}</select><label class="check-row"><input id="method-approved" type="checkbox" />已记录本次采用的方法和重掷许可</label><button id="generate-abilities" type="button" class="primary">生成完整骰池</button><p class="inline-note">生成后进入“分配属性”。方法 III 自动取各属性最高值，其他方法仍须检查分配。</p><details><summary>方法范围与规则依据</summary><p>依据：<a href={source.href}>DMG 印刷第 {source.printedPage} 页 · 属性生成</a></p></details></section>
<section class="paper-section create-step-panel" id="create-panel-assign" data-create-panel="assign" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="create-tab-assign" ><h2 tabindex="-1">确认六项属性分配</h2><p id="current-method"></p><div id="assignment-choices" class="assignment-grid"></div><button id="confirm-assignments" type="button" disabled>检查并确认分配</button><div id="ability-results" class="ability-grid" aria-label="六项原始属性"></div><p>显示原始生成值，尚未加入种族、年龄或其他变化。I / II 每个骰组只能用一次；III 取各项最高；IV 保持整组原顺序。</p><details><summary>查看完整原骰和采用结果</summary><div class="table-wrap"><table class="data-table"><thead><tr><th scope="col">骰组/属性</th><th scope="col">原骰</th><th scope="col">最高三骰之和</th><th scope="col">采用</th></tr></thead><tbody id="candidate-body"></tbody></table></div><p id="history-count" class="small"></p></details></section>
<section class="paper-section create-step-panel" id="create-panel-continue" data-create-panel="continue" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="create-tab-continue" ><h2 tabindex="-1">保存属性，再进入核心创建</h2><p>核对六项属性，点击保存。第二阶段从现有浏览器草稿库选择已确认属性的草稿，继续种族、职业及开局任务。</p><div class="create-score-summary" data-create-scores></div><div class="create-action-row"><button id="save-draft" type="button" class="primary">保存到浏览器</button><a class="create-next-link" href="/character/create/core/">下一阶段：核心资格与开局任务 →</a></div><details><summary>查看草稿保存状态</summary><p id="draft-revision" class="small"></p></details></section><div class="wizard-footer create-step-footer"><button type="button" data-create-prev>上一步</button><span data-create-position></span><button type="button" class="primary" data-create-next>下一步</button></div></div><aside class="context-panel create-summary" aria-label="当前人物摘要"><p class="eyebrow">人物草稿 · 当前可见记录</p><h2 data-create-name>未命名草稿</h2><p data-create-identity>属性生成阶段</p><div class="create-score-summary" data-create-scores></div><p class="muted">此处是原始属性，尚未应用种族调整。</p><p data-create-method>尚未生成属性</p><p data-create-draft-state>确认分配并保存后，再进入第二阶段。</p><details><summary>备份</summary><p>切换步骤前保存进度。</p><a href="/character/import/">未知格式与原件隔离检查 →</a></details></aside></div></section>
<noscript>请启用 JavaScript 以使用车卡。</noscript>
<script>import { startCreation } from '../../../character/creation/controller'; import { startCreationStepNavigation } from '../../../character/ui/creation-step-navigation'; startCreation(); startCreationStepNavigation();</script>
<script>document.getElementById('method-approved')?.closest('label')?.remove();const methodHelp=document.querySelector<HTMLElement>('#create-panel-method h2 + p');if(methodHelp)methodHelp.textContent='玩家先记录骰点和分配；战役方法未预先指定时，由团桌自行处理。';</script>
</div></BaseLayout>
